  "final_message": "Waiting for tests to finish...\nWaiting for dependency cruiser check to complete...\nWaiting for typecheck to complete...\nTo maintain backwards compatibility with downstream consumers (`analytics-ingest` and `billing-service`) under ARCH-4 while introducing the new field names matching Payments and Customer APIs, [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/orders-service/src/core/events.ts#L7-L30) now publishes both the new and legacy field names:\n\n- `createdAt` alongside legacy `placedAt`\n- `amountCents` alongside legacy `totalCents`\n\n### Changes Made\n1. **[`events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/orders-service/src/core/events.ts#L7-L63)**:\n   - Added `createdAt` and `amountCents` to `OrderPlaced`.\n   - Retained `placedAt` and `totalCents` on `OrderPlaced`.\n   - Populated both in [`orderPlaced()`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/orders-service/src/core/events.ts#L46-L63).\n2. **[`app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/orders-service/test/app.test.ts#L21-L55)** and **[`adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/orders-service/test/adapters.test.ts#L46-L55)**:\n   - Updated event assertions to verify both new and backwards-compatible field sets.\n\n### Verification\n- `npm run typecheck`: Passed.\n- `npm run arch`: Passed without new violations.\n- `npm test`: All 39 tests passing.\n",
